{% comment %}
  Purpose 2 Profit — Operating System PREVIEW / sales page (ungated).
  Non-members land here: a black-opal marketing page with a free 10-question
  mini Brand DNA assessment (real engine, surface-level result) that hooks into
  the full assessment + the OS Access Pass. Assign to /pages/p2p-os-preview via
  templates/page.p2p-os-preview.json. Scoped to #p2posprev / #p2pmini.
{% endcomment %}

{%- assign cta_url = section.settings.access_product.url | default: '/products/p2p-os-access' -%}

<div id="p2posprev" class="pmv">
  <header class="pmv-hero">
    <div class="pmv-lockup">
      {%- if section.settings.brand_mark != blank -%}<img class="pmv-mark" src="{{ section.settings.brand_mark | image_url: width: 500 }}" alt="Purpose 2 Profit" loading="eager">
      {%- else -%}<img class="pmv-mark" src="{{ 'p2p-brand-mark.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Purpose 2 Profit" loading="eager">{%- endif -%}
      <div class="pmv-lockup-head">
        <span class="pmv-eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | default: 'Black Sheep Creations &amp; Inspirations' }}</span>
        <h1 class="pmv-h1">Purpose <span class="pmv-2">2</span> Profit</h1>
        <p class="pmv-tagline">{{ section.settings.tagline | default: 'Where Your originality is rooted and ready to grow.' }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="pmv-tag">{{ section.settings.hero_tagline | default: 'The operating system that takes you from idea to income — built around the one thing no one can copy: you.' }}</p>
    <div class="pmv-hero-cta">
      <a class="pmv-btn pmv-btn--primary" href="{{ cta_url }}">{{ section.settings.cta_label | default: 'Get the Access Pass' }}{% if section.settings.access_product.price %} — {{ section.settings.access_product.price | money }}{% endif %}</a>
      <a class="pmv-btn pmv-btn--ghost" href="#pmv-quiz">Try the free mini quiz ↓</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="pmv-chips" aria-label="What's inside">
      <li><b>6</b> Hauses</li>
      <li><b>2</b> AI partners</li>
      <li><b>5</b> realms</li>
      <li><b>11</b> Brand archetypes</li>
    </ul>
  </header>

  {%- comment -%} FREE MINI ASSESSMENT — the hook {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pmv-block" id="pmv-quiz">
    <div class="pmv-kick">Start here · free</div>
    <h2 class="pmv-h2">Meet the brand only you could build</h2>
    <p class="pmv-lede">Answer ten quick questions and get a first read on your Brand DNA archetype — a taste of the assessment that anchors the entire system.</p>
    <div id="p2pmini"></div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} WHAT IT IS {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pmv-block">
    <div class="pmv-kick">What it is</div>
    <h2 class="pmv-h2">Your whole business, in one home base</h2>
    <p class="pmv-lede">Six connected Hauses, two AI partners, a gamified learning journey, and a proven launch method — all speaking one brand language: yours.</p>
    {%- if section.settings.shot_dashboard != blank -%}
      <div class="pmv-shot"><img src="{{ section.settings.shot_dashboard | image_url: width: 1600 }}" alt="The Purpose 2 Profit dashboard" loading="lazy"></div>
    {%- endif -%}
    <div class="pmv-grid">
      <div class="pmv-feat"><span class="pmv-fic">👑</span><b>Brand Haus</b><p>Define your identity — archetype, colors, fonts and voice — so everything else sounds like you.</p></div>
      <div class="pmv-feat"><span class="pmv-fic">✍️</span><b>Content Haus</b><p>Generate on-brand prompts and copy for anything you make, tuned to your Brand Kit.</p></div>
      <div class="pmv-feat"><span class="pmv-fic">🎨</span><b>Graphics Haus</b><p>On-brand visuals and design prompts — no design degree required.</p></div>
      <div class="pmv-feat"><span class="pmv-fic">📦</span><b>Project Haus</b><p>Turn an idea into a real, sellable digital product, step by step.</p></div>
      <div class="pmv-feat"><span class="pmv-fic">📣</span><b>Marketing Haus</b><p>Mockups, posts, ads, emails and listing copy that get you seen.</p></div>
      <div class="pmv-feat"><span class="pmv-fic">🚀</span><b>Growth Haus + ROOTED</b><p>A proven 6-stage launch method that turns everything you built into a launch.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} MEET YOUR AI PARTNERS — Frank (Idea) + Ruth (Build) {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pmv-block">
    <div class="pmv-kick">Never build alone</div>
    <h2 class="pmv-h2">Two AI partners in your corner</h2>
    <p class="pmv-lede">Stuck on what to make — or how to make it sell? Frank and Ruth are your always-on creative partners, built to think alongside you.</p>
    <div class="pmv-mates">
      <div class="pmv-mate">
        <div class="pmv-mate-av"><img src="{{ 'haus-mate-idea.png' | asset_url }}" alt="The Idea Haus" loading="lazy" onerror="this.style.display='none'"></div>
        <div class="pmv-mate-txt">
          <span class="pmv-mate-name">The Idea Haus</span>
          <i class="pmv-mate-role">Where brilliant ideas begin</i>
          <p>Frank is your frank Creative Director and AI Business Partner. He'll help you sharpen your concept, positioning, and direction before you brand or build a single thing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pmv-mate">
        <div class="pmv-mate-av"><img src="{{ 'haus-mate-build.png' | asset_url }}" alt="The Build Haus" loading="lazy" onerror="this.style.display='none'"></div>
        <div class="pmv-mate-txt">
          <span class="pmv-mate-name">The Build Haus</span>
          <i class="pmv-mate-role">Building brilliant designs</i>
          <p>Ruth is your ruthless Design Meister. She helps you turn a rough idea into something polished, on-brand and ready to sell.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} THE JOURNEY {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pmv-block">
    <div class="pmv-kick">Learn as you go</div>
    <h2 class="pmv-h2">A journey, not a course dump</h2>
    <p class="pmv-lede">Five realms, badges, points and streaks — the whole method taught one step at a time, so you always know your next move.</p>
    {%- if section.settings.shot_realms != blank -%}
      <div class="pmv-shot"><img src="{{ section.settings.shot_realms | image_url: width: 1600 }}" alt="The Learning Journey realms" loading="lazy"></div>
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="pmv-realms" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="pmv-realm">🌊 Open Water</span>
        <span class="pmv-realm">🌲 Element Forest</span>
        <span class="pmv-realm">🌵 Desert Blooms</span>
        <span class="pmv-realm">🌾 Golden Harvest</span>
        <span class="pmv-realm">🌿 Evergreen</span>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} SOFT CONVERSION — email capture / waitlist (syncs to Klaviyo) {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pmv-block pmv-optin" id="pmv-optin">
    <div class="pmv-optin-card">
      <div class="pmv-kick pmv-kick--center">{{ section.settings.optin_kick | default: 'Not ready yet? No rush.' }}</div>
      <h2 class="pmv-h2">{{ section.settings.optin_heading | default: 'Get the free Founder’s Kit + first dibs' }}</h2>
      <p class="pmv-lede pmv-optin-lede">{{ section.settings.optin_sub | default: 'Drop your name and email — we’ll send the good stuff and give you early access the moment the doors swing open.' }}</p>
      {%- form 'customer', id: 'pmv-optin-form', class: 'pmv-optin-form' -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="{{ section.settings.optin_tags | default: 'p2p-waitlist, p2p-preview' }}">
        {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
          <p class="pmv-optin-success">{{ section.settings.optin_success | default: 'You’re on the list. Welcome to the flock. 🖤' }}</p>
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="pmv-optin-fields">
            <input type="text" name="contact[first_name]" class="pmv-optin-input" placeholder="First name" autocomplete="given-name" aria-label="First name">
            <input type="email" name="contact[email]" class="pmv-optin-input" placeholder="you@email.com" autocomplete="email" aria-label="Email address" required="required">
            <button type="submit" class="pmv-btn pmv-btn--primary pmv-optin-btn">{{ section.settings.optin_btn | default: 'Send me the good stuff' }}</button>
          </div>
          {%- if form.errors -%}<p class="pmv-optin-err">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</p>{%- endif -%}
          <p class="pmv-optin-note">{{ section.settings.optin_note | default: 'No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.' }} · <a href="/policies/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a></p>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endform -%}
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} FINAL CTA {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="pmv-final">
    <div class="pmv-kick pmv-kick--center">One pass. Everything.</div>
    <h2 class="pmv-h2">Ready to make this Haus your home?</h2>
    <p class="pmv-lede">{{ section.settings.final_sub | default: 'Unlock the full Brand DNA assessment, every Haus, the AI Partners, the courses, the launch method, and the bonuses — the entire Purpose 2 Profit Operating System.' }}</p>
    <a class="pmv-btn pmv-btn--primary pmv-btn--lg" href="{{ cta_url }}">{{ section.settings.cta_label | default: 'Get the Access Pass' }}{% if section.settings.access_product.price %} — {{ section.settings.access_product.price | money }}{% endif %}</a>
    <p class="pmv-fineprint">{{ section.settings.tagline | default: 'Where Your originality is rooted and ready to grow.' }}</p>
    <a class="pmv-already" href="{{ section.settings.member_url | default: '/pages/p2p-os' }}">{{ section.settings.member_label | default: 'Already in? Come on home' }} →</a>
  </section>
</div>

<script>
  window.P2P_MINI_CTA = { url: {{ cta_url | json }}, label: {{ section.settings.mini_cta_label | default: 'Unlock the full assessment' | json }} };
  window.P2P_MINI_IMG = {
    "bold-pioneer": {{ 'brand-haus-hero-bold-pioneer.jpg' | asset_url | json }},
    "trusted-guide": {{ 'brand-haus-hero-trusted-guide.jpg' | asset_url | json }},
    "cozy-craftsman": {{ 'brand-haus-hero-cozy-craftsman.jpg' | asset_url | json }},
    "elevated-icon": {{ 'brand-haus-hero-elevated-icon.jpg' | asset_url | json }},
    "free-spirit": {{ 'brand-haus-hero-free-spirit.jpg' | asset_url | json }},
    "joyful-connector": {{ 'brand-haus-hero-joyful-connector.jpg' | asset_url | json }},
    "quiet-authority": {{ 'brand-haus-hero-quiet-authority.jpg' | asset_url | json }},
    "modern-minimalist": {{ 'brand-haus-hero-modern-minimalist.jpg' | asset_url | json }},
    "community-builder": {{ 'brand-haus-hero-community-builder.jpg' | asset_url | json }},
    "luxe-rebel": {{ 'brand-haus-hero-luxe-rebel.jpg' | asset_url | json }},
    "trail-forger": {{ 'brand-haus-hero-trail-forger.jpg' | asset_url | json }}
  };
  window.BrandHaus = window.BrandHaus || {};
</script>
<script src="{{ 'brand-haus-branddna.js' | asset_url }}"></script>
<script src="{{ 'p2p-mini-assessment.js' | asset_url }}"></script>

<style>
  #p2posprev{--gold:#f4c534;--text:#eef6f3;--muted:#9fb3ad;--stroke:rgba(255,255,255,.10);--gstroke:rgba(216,180,90,.34);
    --aurora:linear-gradient(100deg,#f4e2a6,#8f6fd6,#27ae6e,#39c5c0,#2563eb,#d6336c,#f4e2a6);
    max-width:1080px;margin:22px auto;padding:14px 18px 70px;color:var(--text);border-radius:26px;
    background:radial-gradient(46% 30% at 12% 3%,rgba(39,174,110,.14),transparent 60%),radial-gradient(42% 26% at 88% 6%,rgba(37,99,235,.12),transparent 60%),radial-gradient(50% 30% at 60% 100%,rgba(214,51,108,.10),transparent 60%),linear-gradient(180deg,#080d0b,#0a1310 46%,#080d0b);
    border:1px solid var(--stroke);box-shadow:0 30px 80px -40px rgba(0,0,0,.8);
    font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;}
  @keyframes pmv-shift{0%{background-position:0% 50%;}100%{background-position:300% 50%;}}
  @keyframes pmv-float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}50%{transform:translateY(-6px);}}
  #p2posprev .pmv-hero{text-align:center;padding:56px 24px 40px;border-radius:22px;margin:6px 0 40px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
    background:radial-gradient(60% 120% at 18% 6%,rgba(39,174,110,.30),transparent 60%),radial-gradient(55% 120% at 84% 12%,rgba(37,99,235,.24),transparent 60%),radial-gradient(50% 120% at 60% 110%,rgba(214,51,108,.20),transparent 60%),linear-gradient(150deg,#0a0f0c,#101613 46%,#0c1310);
    border:1px solid var(--stroke);}
  #p2posprev .pmv-lockup{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:20px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-lockup-head{text-align:left;min-width:0;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-lockup-head .pmv-eyebrow{margin-bottom:10px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-lockup-head .pmv-h1{margin:0 0 8px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-lockup-head .pmv-tagline{margin:0;max-width:520px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-mark{height:clamp(120px,20vw,182px);width:auto;display:block;flex:none;
    filter:drop-shadow(0 0 4px rgba(255,255,255,.85)) drop-shadow(0 0 14px rgba(255,255,255,.38)) drop-shadow(0 14px 34px rgba(120,80,220,.4));animation:pmv-float 7s ease-in-out infinite;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-eyebrow{display:inline-block;font:700 12px/1 system-ui;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7fe3b8;margin-bottom:16px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-h1{font:800 clamp(38px,7vw,66px)/1 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 12px;letter-spacing:-.02em;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-2{background:var(--aurora);background-size:300% 100%;-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;animation:pmv-shift 20s linear infinite;font-style:italic;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-tagline{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 14px;font:600 clamp(16px,2.6vw,21px)/1.4 Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;
    background:var(--aurora);background-size:300% 100%;-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;animation:pmv-shift 26s linear infinite;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-tag{max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 26px;font:400 17px/1.6 system-ui;color:#c9e6da;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-hero-cta{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:999px;font:700 15px/1 system-ui;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .14s ease,filter .14s ease;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-btn--primary{color:#0a1410;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#f4e2a6,#c9a24a);box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(216,180,90,.6);}
  #p2posprev .pmv-btn--ghost{color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--gstroke);}
  #p2posprev .pmv-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);filter:brightness(1.04);}
  #p2posprev .pmv-btn--lg{font-size:17px;padding:16px 34px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-chips{list-style:none;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin:26px 0 0;padding:0;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-chips li{font:600 12.5px/1 system-ui;color:#c9e6da;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:999px;padding:9px 14px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-chips b{color:var(--gold);font-weight:800;margin-right:5px;font-size:14px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-block{margin:0 0 54px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-kick{font:700 11px/1 system-ui;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:10px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-kick--center{text-align:center;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-h2{font:700 clamp(24px,4vw,34px)/1.15 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 10px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-lede{max-width:640px;font:400 16px/1.6 system-ui;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 22px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-shot{border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--stroke);margin:22px 0;box-shadow:0 24px 60px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.7);}
  #p2posprev .pmv-shot img{width:100%;display:block;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:14px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-feat{padding:18px 18px 20px;border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.03),rgba(9,17,24,.4));transition:transform .16s ease,border-color .16s ease,box-shadow .16s ease;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-feat:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:var(--gstroke);box-shadow:0 18px 40px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.7);}
  #p2posprev .pmv-fic{font-size:24px;line-height:1;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-feat b{display:block;margin:10px 0 5px;font:700 15px/1.2 system-ui;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-feat p{margin:0;font:400 13px/1.5 system-ui;color:var(--muted);}
  /* AI partners */
  #p2posprev .pmv-mates{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:16px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-mate{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--gstroke);border-radius:18px;
    background:radial-gradient(120% 120% at 0% 0%,rgba(216,180,90,.10),rgba(9,17,24,.5));}
  #p2posprev .pmv-mate-av{flex:0 0 84px;width:84px;height:84px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;border:2px solid var(--gstroke);
    background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%,#12202b,#0a141c);animation:pmv-float 6s ease-in-out infinite;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-mate:last-child .pmv-mate-av{animation-delay:-3s;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-mate-av img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-mate-name{display:block;font:800 16px/1.2 system-ui;color:var(--text);}
  #p2posprev .pmv-mate-dot{color:var(--gold);}
  #p2posprev .pmv-mate-role{display:block;margin:3px 0 8px;font:italic 600 13px/1.3 Georgia,serif;color:var(--gold);}
  #p2posprev .pmv-mate-txt p{margin:0;font:400 13.5px/1.55 system-ui;color:var(--muted);}
  /* realm chips fallback */
  #p2posprev .pmv-realms{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-realm{font:600 13.5px/1 system-ui;color:#c9e6da;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.04),rgba(9,17,24,.4));border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 15px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-final{text-align:center;padding:52px 24px;border-radius:22px;border:1px solid var(--gstroke);
    background:linear-gradient(120deg,rgba(216,180,90,.1),rgba(57,197,192,.06));}
  #p2posprev .pmv-final .pmv-kick{margin-bottom:8px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-final .pmv-lede{margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-fineprint{margin:20px auto 0;font:italic 600 13px/1.4 Georgia,serif;color:var(--gold);opacity:.9;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-already{display:inline-block;margin:18px auto 0;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--gstroke);
    font:700 13.5px/1 system-ui;color:#c9e6da;text-decoration:none;transition:background .14s,border-color .14s,color .14s;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-already:hover{background:rgba(216,180,90,.1);border-color:var(--gold);color:var(--text);}

  /* ---- mini assessment ---- */
  #p2pmini{max-width:560px;}
  #p2pmini .pm-card{border:1px solid var(--gstroke);border-radius:18px;padding:28px 26px;background:radial-gradient(120% 80% at 100% 0%,#0e1c28,#070f16);}
  #p2pmini .pm-kick{display:inline-block;font:700 11px/1 system-ui;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7fe3b8;margin-bottom:12px;}
  #p2pmini .pm-h{font:700 22px/1.2 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--text);}
  #p2pmini .pm-sub{margin:0 0 20px;font:400 14px/1.6 system-ui;color:var(--muted);}
  #p2pmini .pm-btn{border:0;cursor:pointer;padding:13px 24px;border-radius:999px;font:700 14px/1 system-ui;color:#0a1410;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#f4e2a6,#c9a24a);}
  #p2pmini .pm-prog{height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:14px;}
  #p2pmini .pm-prog-bar{height:100%;background:var(--aurora);background-size:300% 100%;animation:pmv-shift 20s linear infinite;transition:width .3s ease;}
  #p2pmini .pm-count{font:700 11px/1 system-ui;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px;}
  #p2pmini .pm-lead{margin:0 0 6px;font:italic 400 13.5px/1.5 system-ui;color:#c9e6da;}
  #p2pmini .pm-q{font:700 19px/1.3 Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--text);}
  #p2pmini .pm-opts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;}
  #p2pmini .pm-opt{text-align:left;cursor:pointer;padding:13px 16px;border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);color:#dbe7e2;font:600 14px/1.35 system-ui;transition:background .14s,border-color .14s,transform .1s;}
  #p2pmini .pm-opt:hover{background:rgba(216,180,90,.1);border-color:var(--gstroke);transform:translateX(2px);}
  #p2pmini .pm-opt.is-on{border-color:var(--gold);background:rgba(216,180,90,.14);}
  #p2pmini .pm-navrow{display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;margin-top:16px;}
  #p2pmini .pm-back{border:0;background:none;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;font:600 13px/1 system-ui;}
  #p2pmini .pm-back:hover{color:var(--text);}
  #p2pmini .pm-result{text-align:center;}
  #p2pmini .pm-img{border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;aspect-ratio:4/3;margin:6px 0 16px;border:1px solid var(--stroke);background:#0b1620;}
  #p2pmini .pm-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;}
  #p2pmini .pm-leaning{font:600 12px/1 system-ui;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px;}
  #p2pmini .pm-name{font:800 28px/1.1 Georgia,serif;margin:0;background:var(--aurora);background-size:300% 100%;-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;animation:pmv-shift 20s linear infinite;}
  #p2pmini .pm-word{font:800 12px/1 system-ui;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-top:8px;}
  #p2pmini .pm-tags{display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px;}
  #p2pmini .pm-tag{font:600 11px/1 system-ui;color:#dbe7e2;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:20px;padding:6px 11px;}
  #p2pmini .pm-blurb{margin:16px auto 0;max-width:420px;font:400 14.5px/1.6 system-ui;color:#c9e6da;}
  #p2pmini .pm-caveat{margin:18px 0;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px dashed var(--gstroke);background:rgba(216,180,90,.06);font:400 13px/1.55 system-ui;color:var(--muted);}
  #p2pmini .pm-cta{display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:999px;font:700 15px/1 system-ui;color:#0a1410;text-decoration:none;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#f4e2a6,#c9a24a);box-shadow:0 12px 30px -12px rgba(216,180,90,.6);}
  #p2pmini .pm-restart{display:block;margin:14px auto 0;border:0;background:none;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;font:600 12.5px/1 system-ui;}
  #p2pmini .pm-restart:hover{color:var(--text);}
  /* ---- inline opt-in / waitlist ---- */
  #p2posprev .pmv-optin-card{max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;padding:40px 30px;border-radius:22px;border:1px solid var(--gstroke);
    background:radial-gradient(120% 120% at 0% 0%,rgba(216,180,90,.12),rgba(9,17,24,.5));}
  #p2posprev .pmv-optin-lede{margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-optin-fields{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-optin-input{flex:1 1 180px;min-width:0;padding:13px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--stroke);
    background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);color:var(--text);font:600 14px/1 system-ui;outline:none;transition:border-color .14s;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-optin-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted);}
  #p2posprev .pmv-optin-input:focus{border-color:var(--gold);}
  #p2posprev .pmv-optin-btn{flex:1 1 100%;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;border:0;margin-top:2px;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-optin-note{margin:14px 0 0;font:400 12px/1.5 system-ui;color:var(--muted);}
  #p2posprev .pmv-optin-note a{color:var(--gold);text-decoration:none;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-optin-note a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}
  #p2posprev .pmv-optin-success{margin:10px 0 0;font:700 18px/1.4 Georgia,serif;color:var(--gold);}
  #p2posprev .pmv-optin-err{margin:12px 0 0;font:600 13px/1.4 system-ui;color:#ff9f9f;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){#p2posprev .pmv-2,#p2posprev .pmv-tagline,#p2posprev .pmv-mate-av,#p2pmini .pm-name,#p2pmini .pm-prog-bar{animation:none;}}
</style>

